      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'No wheel propulsion in orbit. Left stick translates sideways/forward;
    right stick pitches and yaws. Bumpers roll; triggers translate up/down. Hold
    ACTION to brake relative motion; tap it beside a precisely aligned kingpin to
    couple. Keyboard: tap ACTION away from the pin to switch translation/aim, hold
    it with movement for vertical thrust and roll, hold it still to brake; tap beside
    the pin to hitch. Deliver the trailer slowly inside your orbital dock. Fuel and
    contact damage affect your result.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
